    "html": "<div class=\"c-icon-block o-module c-ip-block--grey no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-icon-block__title\"><strong>What we do</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-overlay\" data-mobile-scroll=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-wrap\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__content\" data-mobile-scroll-inner=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img alt=\"Icon of an eye with cataracts.\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/icon-left-cataracts-yellow.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Protecting sight</h3>\n<p><strong>We prevent sight loss and avoidable blindness</strong> in some of the poorest parts of the world by treating conditions such as cataracts and refractive error.<br/>\n<a href=\"/protecting-sight/\">Our work to protect sight</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Sightsavers-icon-medication-left.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Fighting disease</h3>\n<p><strong>We help to treat and prevent five debilitating diseases </strong>that affect more than a billion people. These are known as neglected tropical diseases (NTDs).<br/>\n<a href=\"/diseases/\">About the diseases </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-card o-grid__m-1 o-grid__t-3 o-grid__d-3\" data-mobile-scroll-card=\"\">\n<img \"\"=\"\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-icon-card__image\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Sightsavers-icon-people-left.svg\"/>\n<h3 class=\"c-icon-block__heading\">Disability and inclusion</h3>\n<p><strong>We promote equal opportunities </strong> and campaign for inclusion so everyone can go to school, get a job, access health care and take part in society.<br/>\n<a href=\"/disability-and-inclusion/\">Our inclusion work</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-buttons\">\n<button class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-button\" data-mobile-scroll-dir=\"prev\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"svg-left-arrow\" height=\"49.01\" viewbox=\"0 0 30 49.01\" width=\"30\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>arrow-left</title><path d=\"M28.9 47.9a3.77 3.77 0 0 0 0-5.33L10.67 24.34 28.58 6.43a3.77 3.77 0 1 0-5.33-5.33L.01 24.34 23.57 47.9a3.77 3.77 0 0 0 5.33 0z\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n<span class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-numbers\" data-mobile-scroll-number=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1 /\n\t\t\t\t\t\t3\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n<button class=\"c-icon-block__scroll-button\" data-mobile-scroll-dir=\"next\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"svg-right-arrow\" height=\"49.01\" viewbox=\"0 0 30 49.01\" width=\"30\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>arrow-right</title><path d=\"M1.08 1.1a3.77 3.77 0 0 0 0 5.33l18.23 18.23L1.4 42.57a3.77 3.77 0 0 0 5.33 5.33l23.24-23.24L6.44 1.1a3.77 3.77 0 0 0-5.36 0z\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
