    "style": "",
    "html": "<div class=\"c-text-block-wrapper o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-side-modules c-side-modules--third\">\n<h2 class=\"c-module-heading\"><strong>How we’re run</strong></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-content c-text-block c-text-block--third\">\n<p class=\"lead\">We aim to perform to the highest standards, and we strive to be as transparent as possible so you can be sure your money is being used wisely.</p>\n<p>We can only achieve our goals thanks to the generosity of our supporters. Every gift you give is vital in achieving Sightsavers’ goal of eliminating avoidable blindness and promoting equality for people with disabilities. <a href=\"/how-were-run/\">Read about how we’re run</a></p>\n<p>Our president is Her Royal Highness Princess Alexandra, and our patron is His Majesty The King. <a href=\"/how-were-run/our-royal-ambassadors/\">Read about our royal ambassadors</a></p>\n<hr style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%;\"/>\n<p><strong>Sightsavers in depth:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/how-were-run/annual-reports/\">Our financial reports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-were-run/global-board/\">Meet our board members</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/how-were-run/accountability-and-transparency/\">How we’re accountable</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
