    "html": "<div class=\"c-email-module o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"c-email-module__background\"></div>\n<div class=\"c-email-module__content o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-email-module__left\">\n<h2 class=\"c-email-module__header\">Inspirational stories direct to your inbox</h2>\n<div class=\"c-email-module__image\">\n<img alt=\"Nine-year-old Khadijah at school with her friend after successful cataract surgery. They're sitting at a desk writing on a shared piece of paper, wearing their blue school uniforms.\" aria-describedby=\"c-email-figcaption1405002919\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2211_Sightsavers-khadijah-at-school-with-friend-rufaida-nigeria.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-module__left-content\">\n<div class=\"c-email-module__image-label\" id=\"c-email-figcaption1405002919\">Nine-year-old Khadijah (right) is no longer at risk of going blind.</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-module__bottom-text\">\n<span>Will you help us ensure more children can enjoy a future free from blindness?</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-module__right\">\n<div class=\"c-email-signup\" data-email-signup=\"\">\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__border-wrap\">\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__top\">\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__icon\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"c-email-signup__header\">Inspirational stories direct to your inbox</h4>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-email-signup__desc\">Want to hear more from Sightsavers? Join more than 170,000 supporters who receive inspiring emails about life-changing projects and ways to support our work.\t\t</p>\n<form action=\"#\" class=\"c-email-signup__form\">\n<input name=\"campaign\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"k/Sightsavers/web_subscribers_2021_uk\"/>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__field c-email-signup__field--name\">\n<label class=\"c-email-signup__label\" for=\"name593631044\">\n\t\t\t\t\tFirst name\n\t\t\t\t</label>\n<input autocomplete=\"given-name\" class=\"c-email-signup__input\" id=\"name593631044\" name=\"name\" required=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__field c-email-signup__field--email\">\n<label class=\"c-email-signup__label\" for=\"email593631044\">\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail address\n\t\t\t\t</label>\n<input autocomplete=\"email\" class=\"c-email-signup__input\" id=\"email593631044\" name=\"email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-email-signup__unsub c-email-signup__unsub--inline\">You can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the link in each email, or by contacting our Supporter Care team via <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#177e79717857647e707f6364766172656439786570\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"9cf5f2faf3dceff5fbf4e8effdeaf9eeefb2f3eefb\">[email protected]</span></a><br/><br/>For more information see our <a href=\"/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy/\">privacy policy</a></p>\n<p class=\"c-email-signup__unsub\">You can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the link in each email, or by contacting our Supporter Care team via <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b9d0d7dfd6f9cad0ded1cdcad8cfdccbca97d6cbde\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"d5bcbbb3ba95a6bcb2bda1a6b4a3b0a7a6fbbaa7b2\">[email protected]</span></a></p>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__error\" data-error-invalid=\"The mailing list does not exist.\" data-error-selection=\"Please select the checkbox to submit the form.\" data-error-selections=\"Please select at least one signup item.\" data-error-setup=\"The mailing list has not been set up.\" role=\"alertdialog\"></div>\n<button class=\"c-email-signup__btn c-btn\">\n<span class=\"c-email-signup__btn__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\tSign up\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n<span class=\"c-email-signup__btn__spinner\"></span>\n</button>\n</form>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"c-email-signup__response\" role=\"status\">\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__response-icon\"></div>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__response-head\">\n\t\t\t\tThank you for signing up\n\t\t\t</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__response-desc\">\n\t\t\t\tWe’re so grateful for your support. We’ll be in touch soon with news and stories about our sight-saving work.\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-email-signup__privacy\"><p>For more information see our <a href=\"/terms-and-conditions/privacy-policy/\">privacy policy</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  }
